- Remote browser session (SFTP-backed while modal open)

```json
{
  "$id": "https://supercontrolpanel.dev/schemas/cc/commands/open_remote_browser.json",
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["commandId", "serverId"],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
